*>   2009-10-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 910
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0034.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY LON0034C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 MAX-PRINCIPAL      PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM MAX-LOAN-CALC
    DISPLAY "MAX-PRINCIPAL=" MAX-PRINCIPAL
    STOP RUN.
MAX-LOAN-CALC.
    IF JOB-TENURE >= 5
        COMPUTE MAX-PRINCIPAL = ANNUAL-INCOME * 5
    *> STANDARD EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE - LIMIT 2.25 PER 1998 POLICY
    ELSE IF JOB-TENURE >= 3
        COMPUTE MAX-PRINCIPAL = ANNUAL-INCOME * 3
    ELSE
        COMPUTE MAX-PRINCIPAL = ANNUAL-INCOME * 1.5
    END-IF
    END-IF.
